Subject: RUBY_PATH is the Ruby brew.sh chose

brew.sh exports HOMEBREW_RUBY_PATH, the Ruby it runs brew.rb with; worker scripts (sandbox operations, build.rb) launch it
again. RbConfig.ruby names the same file under MRI, and the program itself when brew is compiled.
---
diff --git a/Library/Homebrew/startup/ruby_path.rb b/Library/Homebrew/startup/ruby_path.rb
index 9fa87e99e7..b118da9827 100644
--- a/Library/Homebrew/startup/ruby_path.rb
+++ b/Library/Homebrew/startup/ruby_path.rb
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
 # typed: strict
 # frozen_string_literal: true
 
-RUBY_PATH = Pathname.new(RbConfig.ruby).freeze
+RUBY_PATH = Pathname.new(ENV.fetch("HOMEBREW_RUBY_PATH", RbConfig.ruby)).freeze
